Refactored `src/report.ts` to eliminate the duplicated accumulation loop shared by `summarizeByCategory`, `summarizeByCountry`, and `summarizeByTier` — extracted a single `summarizeByKey` helper parameterized by a key-selector function, cutting the file from 41 to 25 lines with no logic duplicated across the three exports. `src/order.ts` was already well-factored (matches the report's "no complex functions" finding), so I left it untouched. All exported names/signatures are unchanged, and `node --test src/order.test.ts` still passes all 4 tests.
